mbreuses associations typiquement lyonnaises, dont le "Merle Blanc". A la Libération, le restaurant était repris par le cuisinier Edmond-Henri Lafoy (1903-1985), lui-même membre du Merle Blanc et de l'Ordre du Clou.01062nkm0 2200289   450 0010011000000030065000110050017000760170048000931000041001411160023001822000037002052100035002422150066002773170066003433190065004094610033004744610020005076060017005276060026005446080034005706170011006046170020006156170018006358300023006539300058006769300038007340003345040https://catalogue.bm-lyon.fr/ark:/75584/pf0003345040.locale=fr�20261005212412.070aBML:BML_01ICO001014ccfd124cf0d42PID Fedora  a20260921f19      k  y0frey01      ba  aedybxx    xx    zz10a[Bar des Postes]b[Photographie]  aLyon (Rhône)cs. n.d[19.. ?]  a1 photographie négative sur verrecnoir et blancd24 x 18 cm  aFonds Jules Sylvestre (1859-1936)5FR693836101 : P0546 S 0684  aLicence Ouverte-Open Licence5FR693836101 : NUM_P0546 S 0684 1tPhotographes en Rhône-Alpes 1tJules Sylvestre  aRues2rameau  aConstructions2rameau  aVues d’architecture2frTICO  aFrance  cRhône (France)  dLyon (Rhône)  aRassaert, Philippe  5NUM-2000027120bFR693836101cPARTDIaNUM_P0546 S 0684  bFR693836101cPARTDIaP0546 S 068401500nkm0 2200313   450 0010011000000030065000110050017000760170048000931000041001411160023001822000028002052100041002332150054002743170077003283190063004054610033004684610046005016060023005476060020005706060022005906060020006126080021006326170011006537000059006648300020007239300069007439300049008129800325008610003346052https://catalogue.bm-lyon.fr/ark:/75584/pf0003346052.locale=fr�20261005212357.070aBML:BML_01ICO001014e5de7e05af232PID Fedora  a20260921f19      k  y0frey01      ba  aeeybxx    xx    zz10aBaraqueb[Photographie]  aVilleurbanne (Rhône)cs. n.d[19..]  a1 photographie négativecnoir et blancd6 x 6 cm  aFonds Marcelle Vallet (1909-2000)5FR693836101 : P0701 002BIS N1141 C444  aCC BY-NC